                       "appId":  "qontinui-runner"
                   },
    "description":  "Updates settings tab within the runner Settings panel. Allows users to check for and install application updates. The page auto-checks for updates on mount via the Tauri `check_for_updates` IPC command. It renders a permanent \u0027current version\u0027 card (showing the installed version and last-checked timestamp) and a conditional status card that shows one of four states: checking/idle (no card), development mode (update checking disabled), update available (with release notes and install button), or up to date. A separate error card appears if a check or install fails. An informational tip box is always visible at the bottom.",
